# Build-context trimming for the agent/server images, whose build context is the repo root (so the
# Dockerfiles can COPY <module>/build/libs/*.jar). The images need ONLY the prebuilt bootJar under
# each module's build/libs, so exclude the heavy/irrelevant parts of the tree — a blocklist, so a
# missed entry only makes the context larger, never drops the jar. (The monitored-db image has its
# own small context, deploy/compose/monitored, and is unaffected by this file.)
.git
.gradle
**/.gradle
**/src
**/build/classes
**/build/generated
**/build/resources
**/build/tmp
**/build/reports
**/build/test-results
**/build/spotless
**/bin
docs
demo
scripts
*.md
node_modules
